Laya-Decision (Rust port)
Copyright 2026 the Laya-Decision authors

This product is a Rust port of Laya (https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya),
a non-autoregressive System-1 decision engine, which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See reference/UPSTREAM-LICENSE for the upstream
license text.

Portions of the logic (language detection, routing, email cleaning, question
presets, sequence construction, and calibration) are ported from the upstream
Python package and its official TypeScript port (`laya-ts`). Model inference is
reimplemented natively on candle (https://github.com/huggingface/candle).

The Laya model checkpoints (convaiinnovations/laya and siblings) are distributed
separately on the Hugging Face Hub under their own license and are not included
in this repository.
